                                "sense_id": "b0735688-c9ad-3415-9be5-f279622c4c05",
                                "text": "‘I hope,’ said Mr. Pickwick, ‘that our volatile friend is committing no absurdities in that dickey behind.’\n‘Oh dear, no,’ replied Ben Allen. ‘Except when he’s elevated, Bob’s the quietest creature breathing.’"
